{
  "slug": "lark-feishu-integration",
  "name": "Lark Feishu Integration",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect Claude to your Lark/Feishu workspace. Manage calendar, chat messages, documents, spreadsheets, bitable databases, tasks, email, and meeting transcripts — all from Claude Cowork.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `lark-bitable` (Access Lark Bitable databases - list tables, view fields, and read records), `lark-calendar` (Manage Lark calendar - view schedule, create/update/delete events, check availability, find meeting slots, RSVP to invitations), `lark-contacts` (Look up employee information via Lark - find colleagues by ID, list department members, search users by name,…), `lark-docs` (Read and write Lark documents - get content as markdown or blocks, create new documents, append content (text,…), `lark-email` (Read, search, send, reply, and manage emails from Lark Mail via IMAP/SMTP with local caching), `lark-messages` (Retrieve chat message history, send messages, and manage reactions in Lark - get messages from group chats, private…), `lark-minutes` (Access Lark Minutes recordings - get metadata, export transcripts, download audio/video), `lark-sheets` (Read and write Lark Sheets (spreadsheets) - list sheets, read cell data, write values, create spreadsheets, add tabs,…), and 1 more\n- **Commands** (1): `lark-setup` (Set up or troubleshoot the lark-cli tool for Lark/Feishu integration)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lark-feishu-integration@claude-community` from `seahyc/lark-cowork-plugin`.",
